'''Potion''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2017 Halloween box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2017|2017 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance ==
Its blade is purplish-magenta with bubbles on it, resembling a witch’s potion, hence the name. The guard is purple, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
*Its model, published by [[Nikilis]], can be found [https://www.roblox.com/library/1133366632/Potion here].

